{
  "id": "making-new-friends",
  "title": "認識新朋友",
  "titleEn": "Making New Friends",
  "category": "社交人際",
  "level": "中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/making-new-friends.webp",
    "alt": "在陽光灑落的學校中庭走廊旁，兩名國中生倚著木質長椅交談，一位揹著黑色吉他袋，兩人拿著手機互換聯絡方式，氣氛輕鬆融洽。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "During lunch break, Leo sits on a courtyard bench and starts a "
        },
        {
          "text": "conversation",
          "wordIds": [
            "conversation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with a new "
        },
        {
          "text": "friend",
          "wordIds": [
            "friend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " named Sam."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "午休時，Leo 坐在中庭的長椅上，與一位名叫 Sam 的新朋友開啟了交談。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "50b61e835444447d88496764163f594ff69099d9e2774d590bc5ace679c4d8d4",
        "sha256": "2638e057cd2adab6e7a90ff298fafac0ea35ad697497a2dbbfd3c13df4383b40"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Curious about Sam's interests, Leo turns to him and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What do you like to do?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-do-you-like-to-do"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 對 Sam 的興趣感到好奇，轉向他問道：「你平時喜歡做什麼？」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "6480c37299a3f0ba6da4bb0189ba531de7e01b7631b52655d58739d4e3958fb7",
        "sha256": "faf775cbccf12767bb7edcd1c6becb6ee85b4fb788d8699745d5b81e26622055"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sam points to his instrument case and replies, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I love playing ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-playing-guitar"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "guitar",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-playing-guitar"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "guitar"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-love-playing-guitar"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Sam 指著自己的樂器盒回答：「我非常喜歡彈吉他。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "af90002dfbecdd95170bba35fe17271cd28807c0730a14a5f2a6793df2fbe34d",
        "sha256": "efd4571efff22d84ae715747470812fadaf7b55b1478ee62fd74a99195c76cb2"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo's eyes light up with excitement as he replies, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Me too!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "me-too"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 興奮地眼睛一亮，回答道：「我也是！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f58f5406369b9b0586c3e9e4994874d01cb1954b9a995204769b32a4f1dd2f36",
        "sha256": "3f0bb2eb8e1269623cfc17ee3ebc5a76f481a941b09065ddd7a306fe9d85ff9e"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They quickly realize that "
        },
        {
          "text": "music",
          "wordIds": [
            "music"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is their shared "
        },
        {
          "text": "hobby",
          "wordIds": [
            "hobby"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and discuss the songs they "
        },
        {
          "text": "listen",
          "wordIds": [
            "listen"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to after school."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們很快發現音樂是彼此共同的嗜好，並聊起放學後經常聆聽的歌曲。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "c3f56509923ef08eb7c7ca4707ba4304c38bebd95e760374ee1ab43a7f632c15",
        "sha256": "75f2837b964a5ca06768bde6f5bebd32eb65ea2868d9529836587121e7a12938"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Before the bell rings, they gladly exchange contact information, and Sam says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's hang out sometime.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-hang-out-sometime"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在鐘聲響起之前，他們開心地交換了聯絡方式，Sam 說：「我們有空一起出去玩吧。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/making-new-friends/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "b56c2b1af9d3be0bf4eca5f49ace5d63e088fe21cd39a4852312ed1dc34c1c8e",
        "sha256": "6c1fc3ba817cc0605d5e2141f5427d8d0a57b2e852b442b0aabe50b1476e86c0"
      }
    }
  ],
